<h1>Payment failed — you've been moved to Free</h1>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>We weren't able to process your GateML Pro payment. Your account has been temporarily downgraded to the <strong>Free plan</strong> until a successful payment is made.</p>

<div class="highlight">
  <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#e5e5e5;">Your account is now limited to:</p>
  <p style="margin:2px 0;font-size:14px;color:#fde68a;">⚠ &nbsp;1,000 requests / month</p>
  <p style="margin:2px 0;font-size:14px;color:#fde68a;">⚠ &nbsp;1 API key pair</p>
  <p style="margin:2px 0;font-size:14px;color:#fde68a;">⚠ &nbsp;7-day log retention</p>
</div>

<p>To restore your Pro access, update your payment method or retry the charge from your billing dashboard:</p>

<p style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0;">
  <a class="btn" href="{{billingUrl}}">Update Payment Method</a>
</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;">If you believe this is an error or need help, reply to this email and we'll sort it out right away.</p>
